{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d1d0000000000001","type":"text","x":0,"y":-390,"width":2700,"height":260,"text":"# 双重差分法（DID）\n\nDID 的主线不是一条回归式，而是：**用谁的变化构造谁的反事实 → 哪些假设让这个替代成立 → 处理时序复杂后如何保住同一个因果问题**。每张卡只显示一个可独立回忆或应用的判断；点击标题进入中英双语原子。\n\n连续阅读：[[02_Economy/01_Econometrics/14_双重差分法#双重差分法（DID）|从缺失反事实到错位处理与透明聚合]]。颜色只表示本图中的语义角色，不表示掌握度；来源状态与掌握状态在 [[知识原子.base|知识原子 Base]] 中查询。"},
		{"id":"d1d0000000000002","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":450,"height":180,"text":"## [[双重差分法]]\n*Difference-in-differences*\n\n用对照组的同期变化构造处理组未处理时的反事实变化。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d1d0000000000003","type":"text","x":510,"y":0,"width":450,"height":180,"text":"## [[平行趋势]]\n*Parallel trends*\n\n约束的是未处理潜在结果的变化，不要求两组水平相同。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d1d0000000000004","type":"text","x":1020,"y":0,"width":450,"height":180,"text":"## [[DID无预期条件|无预期]]\n*No anticipation*\n\n公告或准备若已改变结果，日历上的 pre-period 就不再是未处理基准。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d1d0000000000005","type":"text","x":1530,"y":0,"width":450,"height":180,"text":"## [[2×2 DID 识别 ATT|何时识别 ATT]]\n*When DID identifies the ATT*\n\n四格 DID 只有在反事实条件成立时才等于处理组平均效应。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"d1d0000000000006","type":"text","x":2040,"y":0,"width":460,"height":180,"text":"## [[2×2 DID回归等价|四格回归等价]]\n*Regression equivalence*\n\n交互项等于四格 DID 是代数事实，不是因果识别的证明。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"d1d0000000000007","type":"text","x":0,"y":360,"width":450,"height":190,"text":"## [[DID 的样本构成变化|样本构成]]\n*Sample composition*\n\n均值变化可能来自换了一批观察对象，而不是同一总体发生变化。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"d1d0000000000008","type":"text","x":510,"y":360,"width":450,"height":190,"text":"## [[DID 的外溢污染|组间外溢]]\n*Interference and spillovers*\n\n对照组若被间接处理，它的变化就不再是干净的未处理反事实。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"d1d0000000000009","type":"text","x":1020,"y":360,"width":450,"height":190,"text":"## [[DID 协变量调整|协变量调整]]\n*Covariate adjustment*\n\n条件平行趋势、共同支持（overlap）与目标总体必须一起说明；不能控制处理后变量。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"d1d000000000000a","type":"text","x":1530,"y":360,"width":450,"height":190,"text":"## [[前趋势检验边界|pretrend 不是证明]]\n*Pretrends are not proof*\n\n不显著可能只是功效低；通过预检后再报告还会扭曲推断。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"d1d000000000000b","type":"text","x":2040,"y":360,"width":460,"height":190,"text":"## [[事件研究系数语境|事件研究的估计对象]]\n*Event-study estimands*\n\n每个系数都依赖省略期、窗口、样本与处理批次（cohort）的具体比较。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"d1d0000000000011","type":"text","x":0,"y":740,"width":450,"height":200,"text":"## [[DID结果尺度]]\n*Outcome scale is part of identification*\n\n水平、对数或比例尺度会改变平行趋势条件和待估处理效应。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d1d000000000000c","type":"text","x":510,"y":740,"width":500,"height":200,"text":"## [[错位 DID 的已处理对照|错位处理下的 TWFE]]\n*Conventional TWFE under staggered adoption*\n\n它会混合许多 2×2 比较，并可能用已处理组充当对照。","color":"1"},
		{"id":"d1d000000000000d","type":"text","x":1080,"y":740,"width":500,"height":200,"text":"## [[Group-time ATT 聚合|处理批次—时期 ATT]]\n*Estimate first, aggregate for the question*\n\n先估计处理批次—时期效应，再按人数、暴露时长或日历时间透明聚合。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"d1d000000000000e","type":"text","x":1650,"y":740,"width":500,"height":200,"text":"## [[错位 DID 的吸收处理条件|首次处理时点何时够用]]\n*When first adoption fully represents treatment*\n\n只有二元、吸收式处理才能仅凭首次进入时点定义处理批次；连续剂量或反复切换需要完整处理路径。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"shared-cluster-015","type":"text","x":2210,"y":740,"width":490,"height":200,"text":"## [[聚类标准误边界]]\n*Shared inference boundary*\n\n聚类要覆盖共同处理或冲击层级；独立簇很少时默认大样本推断仍不可靠。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"d1d000000000000f","type":"text","x":510,"y":1120,"width":500,"height":200,"text":"## [[DDD 的偏差消除条件|三重差分 DDD]]\n*Triple differences*\n\n第三个差分只有在两个 DID 的偏差可比时才能把共同偏差消掉。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d1d0000000000010","type":"text","x":1120,"y":1100,"width":1030,"height":240,"text":"## [[DID 估计目标与对照组|从研究问题走到可报告结果]]\n*From the estimand to a defensible result*\n\n先定义处理、目标参数和逐期对照，再论证平行趋势与无污染；之后才选择估计量、窗口、协变量、聚类层级和稳健性检查。最终报告必须让读者看见每个效应是谁与谁的比较。","color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"d1e0000000000001","fromNode":"d1d0000000000002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"d1d0000000000003","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"对照组变化只有在这项反事实限制下才能替代"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000002","fromNode":"d1d0000000000003","fromSide":"right","toNode":"d1d0000000000005","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"与无预期共同把第二个差分变成 ATT"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000003","fromNode":"d1d0000000000004","fromSide":"right","toNode":"d1d0000000000005","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"保证基准期仍观测未处理结果"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000004","fromNode":"d1d0000000000005","fromSide":"right","toNode":"d1d0000000000006","toSide":"left","toEnd":"none","label":"因果识别 ≠ 四格代数等价"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000005","fromNode":"d1d0000000000007","fromSide":"right","toNode":"d1d0000000000005","toSide":"bottom","toEnd":"arrow","label":"四个均值必须代表定义清楚的目标总体"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000006","fromNode":"d1d0000000000008","fromSide":"top","toNode":"d1d0000000000005","toSide":"bottom","toEnd":"arrow","label":"被政策污染的对照组不再提供未处理变化"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000007","fromNode":"d1d0000000000003","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d0000000000009","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"可改成处理前 X 下的条件平行趋势"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000008","fromNode":"d1d0000000000003","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d000000000000a","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"处理前数据只能排查，不会观察处理后的反事实"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000009","fromNode":"d1d0000000000004","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d000000000000b","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"预期窗口决定哪些处理前事件期（lead）真是未处理期"},
		{"id":"d1e000000000000a","fromNode":"d1d0000000000006","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d000000000000c","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"四格等价不能外推到错位处理"},
		{"id":"d1e000000000000b","fromNode":"d1d000000000000b","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d000000000000c","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"动态 TWFE 还会把其他事件期效应混进来"},
		{"id":"d1e000000000000c","fromNode":"d1d000000000000c","fromSide":"right","toNode":"d1d000000000000d","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"先拆成可解释的处理批次—时期效应再聚合"},
		{"id":"d1e000000000000d","fromNode":"d1d0000000000002","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d000000000000f","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"第三个差分继续消除可比较的 DID 偏差"},
		{"id":"d1e000000000000e","fromNode":"d1d000000000000a","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d0000000000010","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"诊断证据不能替代设计论证"},
		{"id":"d1e000000000000f","fromNode":"d1d000000000000d","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d0000000000010","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"先定义要汇总的效应，才知道如何加权"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000010","fromNode":"d1d000000000000e","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d0000000000010","toSide":"right","toEnd":"arrow","label":"先确认首次进入时点能否完整编码处理路径，再选择方法"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000012","fromNode":"d1d000000000000e","fromSide":"left","toNode":"d1d000000000000d","toSide":"right","toEnd":"arrow","label":"只有首次进入能编码整条路径时，处理批次—时期参数才按此定义"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000011","fromNode":"d1d000000000000f","fromSide":"right","toNode":"d1d0000000000010","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"额外比较维度必须有独立识别理由"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000013","fromNode":"d1d0000000000003","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d0000000000011","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"变换结果会重新定义平行趋势和效应尺度"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000014","fromNode":"d1d0000000000011","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d0000000000010","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"先由问题和机制选择结果尺度"},
		{"id":"d1e0000000000015","fromNode":"shared-cluster-015","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d1d0000000000010","toSide":"right","toEnd":"arrow","label":"识别之后仍要让推断匹配分配与依赖结构"}
	]
}